#1.LOG CORRELATED TO DOWN LOG 8-NOV-1996.
#2. TOOLS RUN AS PER TOOL SKETCH,WITH SRT AND LDT EXCENTRALIZED WITH CALIPERS.
#3. CNT EXCENTRALIZED WITH BOW SPRING.
#4. 2.5" STAND OFFS ON THE AMS, SDC, SLR, SLS.
#5. DLT CENTRALIZED WITH FOUR CMEZ'S.
#6.NOTE* 0.9 (KILOGRAM/METER CUBE) BROMIDE TRACER ADDED TO MUD PRIOR TO LOGGING.
#7.GR RUN TO SURFACE THROUGH 13-3/8" CASING.
#8. ARRAY SONIC WAVE FORM TAPING RECORDED OVER THE ENTIRE INTERVAL.
#9. LDT CALIPER CLOSED AT 843 M AND SRT CALIPER CLOSED AT 800 M TO FREE-UP TOOL
#    IN CASING
#10. REPEAT SECTION PRESENTED FROM 2245 M TO 2185 M.
#11. THE LDT CALIPER WAS STUCK AT 1050 M. HENCE BOTH CALIPERS WERE SHUT FOR
#      APPROXIMATELY 5 M. THE RESULT OF THIS IS INDICATED BY AN ERATIC LLD, LLS
#     AND MSFL  RESPONSE.
